<title>UK: Reckitt &amp; Colman down ex-dividend.</title>
<headline>Reckitt &amp; Colman down ex-dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Reckitt &amp; Colman Plc were marked lower in early trading on Tuesday as the stock went ex a special dividend of 35.65p.</p>
<p>The stock was down 36-3/8p at 711-1/2 by 0833 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
